title: Fund-raising
subtitle: The party's treasury is empty again.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: rf_party
view-if: rf_funds_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rf_funds_timer = 2

= Fund-raising

Dues buy less every week. The treasurer asks how the party should pay for its offices, its papers and its organisers.

- @collection
- @dues
- @moscow

@collection
title: A collection in the factories and the streets.
subtitle: +2 resources. A little more standing everywhere the collectors go.
on-arrival: {!
Q.funds += 2;
Q.members += 1;
window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

Comrades rattle tins outside the factory gates and the labour exchanges.

@dues
title: Raise the dues and index them to the dollar.
subtitle: +3 resources. Some members drop out.
on-arrival: {!
Q.funds += 3;
Q.members -= 4;
window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

The dues are pegged to a gold value. The treasurer is pleased; the poorest members are not.

@moscow
title: Ask the International for help.
subtitle: +3 resources. Moscow's standing for the leadership rises; the party loses some autonomy.
on-arrival: {!
Q.funds += 3;
Q[Q.leader + '_moscow'] += 2;
Q.autonomy -= 2;
window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

The money arrives in dollars. With it come reports, instructions and representatives.
